{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>由選秀節目「宇宙啦啦隊」出道的女團「W!nky」成員妃妃遭爆料疑似介入他人婚姻，妃妃對此發出聲明，表示網絡上關於她的討論部分與事實不符，已交由律師處理，請外界不要過度揣測或解讀，為避免影響其他成員，她也決定暫時退出團體活動。</p><p>「W!nky」成團不過短短6天，就有成員被爆捲入感情風波。</p><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139514804273156096542973.jpeg/XrA8ZtwHWw0EBStCZCEPM3mb1DpHCKqrJsEqnCbBKpw\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><p>點擊查看網民爆料「W!nky」成員妃妃介入他人婚姻：</p><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516704506777600867540.jpeg/lT9rLt9fx9-Ekq-vUQsoJsKk9-QYnoTGFaRQ9xWkUPc\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516707082211328538201.jpeg/pl_cxvVDxVhf58yaHFVvNo42u2PSoZDVr87etq_O3rY\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516709582147584154873.jpeg/NJpXjO5huKa-WxNSV42Ot6ZAvAAcNep6M-m4MzPpuDM\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516712103055360256389.jpeg/HfpKoEy9Iv8usF5G0V66vOr2ZeEZGQI4lhDvaZYQ72k\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516714493939712634259.jpeg/jhubjlbTqPJiRg7_XZ2fBpt_NCOe00t_NsG1xjbBtcY\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516707044331520875106.jpeg/97ExErkpG4bu24G8jE4GVyWXAt9fLbpBIBde5CAXXuQ\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516709300998144760954.jpeg/RhtJ-ptpFYUm67--cXj7I_qC6FrWeePNaIe3CmiHtwo\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516711733825536236945.jpeg/Q8GMQLuna4Elo5lajlf289pKpatD0Op2dBh98nQYffI\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516714145681408248613.jpeg/5ckDO9TnS-rxGF_pyfbx4WAT2nC61BxDgSGOq4Ehjqs\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516716444291072280635.jpeg/GQp5RoeaBsAVJFMcwwJ4rhRO5d0sFHf2T2fDsk9nw7I\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516706696204288912847.jpeg/guS-tGCE-tKupdS22t0QoaetPzuiQtrbj5950o-fedI\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516709074505728749851.jpeg/t3HyUUItukA7KClu9RBn9_bSoqvRJh310pN3BNKTdwQ\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516711465390080604829.jpeg/oACYkDBlNgqAiRaj1EFDVBohFT_9O9VwPfKr8z3yq_M\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516713734639616356781.jpeg/8JlQ8FVXXzXQ3mDQazr3Pff6DaBgkNmpUCFK7FAhSuw\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139516715785785344301286.jpeg/O0WPtavPy5AVO_-VdlqaqWJrt9aRYetXd955E3feeRM\"/><figcaption>「宇宙啦啦隊」出道女團「W!nky」成員妃妃（Instagram@qian_yuii）</figcaption></figure><p>有網友在社交平台發文，指女團成員中有人在大學時期和老師發展出師生戀，甚至還疑似介入他人婚姻，因為貼文同時附上多張過往合照，網絡討論持續發酵，還有網友挖出男方社群的發文，男方在文中坦承外遇並且已經離婚，對此他深感抱歉和遺憾，不過目前文章已全數刪除。</p><p>妃妃發出聲明表示：</p><p>她也決定暫時退出團體活動。而稍晚「宇宙啦啦隊」製作單位也表示：「我們尊重妃妃的決定，並由衷感謝她一路以來的努力與付出。妃妃自即日起將暫停團體活動，W!nky後續的相關活動則將依原定規劃持續進行。再次感謝所有粉絲朋友一直以來的支持、理解與關心」。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：泰最強顏值Aum Luk突暗轟前夫偷食　嘆真愛太痛　昔日死撐無出軌】Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138105428899532800437958.jpeg/QSCsLDaT1RXCVwF5MAmoGdiPqzwiAr9xsgvRO7IL0Ts\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：泰最強顏值Aum Luk突暗轟前夫偷食　嘆真愛太痛　昔日死撐無出軌】Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138105640107905024356970.jpeg/6pEVOOTsWCMU-M7Sggqe1Zqu6ge_KMSQfHKyvnxysr4\"/><figcaption>Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138105642729476096526014.jpeg/xoG-VdLia9ibvlc7v-5Lv9AbBhH92ilcqXzZG6l82Rs\"/><figcaption>Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138105645028085760802314.jpeg/yz2yHVGF4jJMvrz6WKnQX8lycxxYSXSTStjRYkrY0WI\"/><figcaption>Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138105647452524544862319.jpeg/5kVnk29a-oW5YB-r7pxFzBYoc5tdX6oO0hi-TNIYvkw\"/><figcaption>Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138105649533030400023816.jpeg/zNFfeFwN7e5vkDcibO_uovdPMsI7UeJVDfU0pQ31NKU\"/><figcaption>Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138105643568205824185027.jpeg/reeGqGtP2ywD0OiRLZ4dWnhW8ijBpmCJUm59UVJufVE\"/><figcaption>Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138105646454018048740813.jpeg/vcNV2Slj1kNcJGqVu8-PL35Iwx9p8J865EyFF-RMhRc\"/><figcaption>Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138105648479997952785490.jpeg/bSQbDgVNvkMyfKGbIb_r0Hzgv7uOXjkCkmQiqJJkIqg\"/><figcaption>Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138105650598252544298604.jpeg/TND4kyx7rJK3kZY4_ldrFaZOrjzsU0zvHMI0rhzCNK4\"/><figcaption>Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138105652951388160019325.jpeg/_f7HCMVEqdgqLBepqBCgL3KLPbN-LElNPpLZvD6S2bw\"/><figcaption>Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aum Luk（藝名Uri）（Instagram@lukkanaaum）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138105640544112640986350.jpeg/A4ryS1